{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "74724ae70bf257d5edce657aa22cdd3d598b33ace88f0f194cbf1a2d62cbbfc0", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。お疲れさまですっ！\n社長さんから、お話があるそうですよ？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n社长有话要跟你说喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "842ec95d2a5f38ae736cb91be1cbc04d1683e0c1edce6dac93701fcab1bbec55", "ja": "おっ、そうですか。わかりました。\nじゃあ、この後にでも社長のところに寄ってみます。", "zh": "喔！是吗？我知道了。\n那我待会就去社长那边看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "07041f80a2e18272280ac25001b2bef424f6fe60ff611c10326102b4faad561c", "ja": "あ、それと……{$P$}さんって、\n確かCDをたくさん持っていましたよね？", "zh": "啊，还有……{$P$}先生，\n我记得你有很多CD对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ff878e0a27aedafe921a48218d1d817448f8006f7341ea9358200dd35503897c", "ja": "CD？　ええ、そうですね。劇場のみんなと\n作ったCDだけで、かなりの数になりますし……。", "zh": "CD？嗯，对啊。\n光是和剧场偶像们推出的CD，就有相当的数量了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "a7bb6d474dc8e6c343f055a3d0e21936f2eac42a24df629467b8dd09316ce14d", "ja": "そうですよねぇ。", "zh": "这么说也是呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4a4a5ef677d45557a3efd07b40ff50ff61a7edf0224e3894aeab237e84c49feb", "ja": "それ以外にも自分の趣味で買ったCDもあるし。\n最近はさすがに置き場所に困っている状況で……。", "zh": "其他还有我自己买来听的CD，\n最近真的很烦恼要摆在哪里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "5bda4fe8ad0a8ad66c59059d60e2089c70b47f0d65aab71f456453d73c1c841d", "ja": "わかります。\nとってもよくわかります！", "zh": "我可以体会，\n完全可以体会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e4031524723c18621dd6c9449615dce805860e69401e0b2d979a8f69c00d64f8", "ja": "取引先からもらったCDが被ることも……あ、そうだ。\n被ってるCD、青羽さんもらってくれませんか？", "zh": "有时还会从客户那边拿到重复的CD……啊，对了。\n青羽小姐，你要不要我那边重复的CD呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "85956d81575f357e86dc028e98228fa73c354a0567a51622d46c525ae6961508", "ja": "わぁ、いいんですか？　ありがとうございます♪\n……あれ？", "zh": "哇！可以吗？谢谢你♪\n……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8eec847e68c537f5a1a55e4fa876fed4b0d63273d33617134365cb124c87b7ca", "ja": "そういえば、社長が呼んでるんでしたよね。\n俺、ちょっと行ってきます。", "zh": "对了，社长在找我。\n那我过去看看啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "24335d817a4be541832fe20acc6fce87de32ddf0dc3e46938fa0fcb41917aa90", "ja": "あ、はい！　当てが外れちゃいましたけど……\nでもCD、楽しみにしてますね。いってらっしゃーい！", "zh": "啊，好的！虽然结果跟我想的不同……\n不过我很期待收到CD喔。路上小心──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "880bdf2a76a2e17f421ddb6494a6fdb1a476a1cfa2ef09b3c34800be54a6c193", "ja": "失礼します、社長。\nお話というのは……？", "zh": "打扰了，社长。\n请问有什么事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "9f6508265cc9906c92ad57e0c9a046085d54dbf1dfa1c2e641658fc2ff642025", "ja": "おお、よく来てくれた。実は君の企画書について、\n詳しい話を聞かせてもらいたくてね。", "zh": "喔喔，你来啦。\n是这样的，关于你提出的企划书，我想要多了解一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "0f7863325479b74115c858359d7fa526e9438a8322f4e00e3c365032f9bb30c8", "ja": "『ロックでクールでオルタナティブなビジュアル系\nデュオユニット』とは、随分攻めた企画じゃないか。", "zh": "『摇滚、酷帅、另类的视觉系双人组团体』，\n这还真是勇敢的企划啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8d099192222e8533b8132fa9cb68a77f33732586bf0678bf4d0869595657dbbd", "ja": "はい。少し挑戦的、でしたかね……？", "zh": "是，请问这样会不会太有挑战性了点……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "515c102aa98e7c34414496d1c3fcd23ae984f96536f7cf80244975582ab87fc9", "ja": "いや、面白いと思うよ？\nだからこそ、君の詳しい構想を聞かせてほしい。", "zh": "不会，我觉得很有趣喔。\n所以我才想找你来听听进一步的构想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "471ab6dda884245b7d4ae98e92164d42ea0a266a0697e09b4b19dce63c6ec673", "ja": "デュオ……ふたり組のユニットということになるが、\nメンバー候補に考えているのは誰なのかね？", "zh": "双人组……你说要组成双人团体，\n那么你心目中的团员名单有谁呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "820bfc8fa286b9919d94ea7cabd428631d16643b67edb63fb8e098725f9c40ba", "ja": "そうですね、真っ先に思いついたのは……。", "zh": "这个嘛，我最先想到的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "becf6111e10aa39644c2967018db8012dc123c3773e1523f8a4b4a9f103ceca4", "ja": "ロックで、クールで、オルタナティブで、ビジュアル系\n……ときたら、やっぱりジュリアちゃんですよね！", "zh": "摇滚、酷帅、另类、视觉系……\n这样的话，首选就是茱莉亚了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "84c7ef41152ec7ad1cc4e2a4c4806319c21eefb98025d9d3108e633cd1da7e7e", "ja": "わっ、音無さん、言わないでくださいよ。\nでも正解です。ひとりはジュリアを考えていました。", "zh": "哇！音无小姐，请你别破哏嘛。\n不过你说对了，我想到的第一个人就是茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "ca5a9e4744e9a447ff2bf918358faf73e4c3ed4d49165aa3845789cc7013f2f7", "ja": "うふふっ。ごめんなさ～い。\nそれで、ジュリアちゃんの相棒には、誰を？", "zh": "呵呵，抱歉啦～\n然后呢？要找谁来担任茱莉亚的搭档？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f1884ceac4891ec38b99eb69fd40f6658f91e383769609acfed6b9b87c8744b5", "ja": "はい。……静香に、やってもらおうかと。", "zh": "搭档……我想要找静香来担任。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "22b13ea6f81424b77ab34eb3431159d5b13ec029be1ef9767e6b5ae465694210", "ja": "ほう！　これは珍しい組み合わせだね。\nどちらも歌唱力に定評はあるが、タイプはまるで違う。", "zh": "喔！这还真是少见的组合。\n两位的歌唱能力评价都不错，但是类型却大相迳庭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "1ccbf15d5d2a51f15cc101c49b5c2f8d47a8be5e8622fdc9e619173b0460c0f6", "ja": "……そんなふたりだからこそ、きっと素晴らしい\n化学反応を見せてくれるんじゃないかと。", "zh": "……我正是觉得这两位组合起来，\n一定会出现很棒的化学反应。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "3a5a7cbaaba3da9e8223c36b73061ea3fe6354f148c851f4626f223edacda29e", "ja": "ふむ、実にいいじゃないか！　この企画、承認しよう。\n私も、その化学反応とやらを見てみたくなったよ。", "zh": "嗯，实在非常棒！这个企划通过了。\n我也想见识你说的那个化学反应。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "d4311d5d693cc6d9f3587ac6149c1114a6a1e8bf187e9b441c54386b472b0e11", "ja": "本当ですか！？　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "真的吗！？非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "b8aa423a3ced6694ef40e69eee33bce39ed903e63d8ec6c24ba564698e8dd6e0", "ja": "ロックでクールでオルタナティブなビジュアル系……。\n期待だけで、ご飯3杯はいけちゃいそうですっ♪", "zh": "摇滚、酷帅、另类的视觉系团体……\n光是期待就够我配三碗饭了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "f58c94d2fda32689b8a76fb24b2d54dae2ca71bb5f491a69b53534eba758847d", "ja": "（音無さんにも期待されていることだし、頑張ろう！\nよし、まずはメンバーふたりに連絡して……）", "zh": "（音无小姐也很期待，我要加油！\n好，先联络两位团员吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
